<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Elder: You showed us what you got, and\nit’s... it’s good...\rTake this TM.\rBut you gotta show your homies more\nLOVE. You treat ’em cold, youngblood.\rHomies ain’t tools for war...\nThey family. Like that cousin you\fdon’t like but still invite.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\r...Hmph!\nHe call himself the Elder, but he\fwas no match for me.\rFunny how the ones preachin’ about\nbein’ “nice” to homies...\fAlways lose to me.\rAll I care about is strong homies\nthat win every time.\rThe rest don’t mean nothin’\nto me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} called\nthe Getaway Car!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LOOK who finally showed up!\rSprout Tower is where folks and homies\ntest their bond.\fI’m the final test. And the landlord.\rLemme see how tight you and your\nhomies DEADASS are!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmm...\nYou scrap real smooth.\rYou can handle Falkner,\nno doubt.\rAnd you can put this to use...\rIt’s a TM called Ring Light.\nTake it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When a homie learn Ring Light, you\ncan light up caves no matter how dark\fthey.\rTry it on BELLSPROUT,\nfor example...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Learn and grow out there, youngblood.\nAnd moisturize. The wind out there\fbrutal.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A powerful paintin’ of a BELLSPROUT.\nKinda fire, ngl. Belongs in a museum.\fOr a dentist office.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0056_D15R0103_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A homie statue...\nIt look real distinguished.</language>
	</row>
</body>
